sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operador (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-role-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-role-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CONS as Consumidores (ipm.user, ipm.group)

  U->>API: POST /v1/ipm/roles {key, displayName, permissions, deletionProtection}
  API->>API: valida token JWT, permissão ipm.role.create, e-mail verificado
  API->>API: valida permissions contra catálogo (CatalogConsumer de ipm.permission)
  API->>API: valida cota de roles custom por organização (máx 10)
  API->>DB: Transação SQL atômica: INSERT ipm.role (Ready), INSERT outbox, INSERT idempotency
  API-->>U: 201 Created (Resource completo: phase Ready, observedGeneration 1)
  P->>DB: lê outbox pendente por ordem de sequence
  P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.role.<resourceId>
  P->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
  NATS->>CONS: entrega desired.changed para caches e projeções locais
